---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = new Date('2026-09-12');
const formatted = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-GB', {
  day: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
  year: 'numeric',
  timeZone: 'UTC',
}).format(updated);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Now"
  description="What I am working on, reading and thinking about at the moment."
>
  <section class="wrap wrap--prose page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Now</p>
    <h1>What I am working on at the moment.</h1>

    <p class="page__updated">Last updated {formatted}</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Working on</h2>

      <p>
        AI-assisted compliance and vulnerability remediation at Microsoft. The focus is making
        security operations more auditable and less dependent on manual reporting. The
        questions I keep returning to are simple to ask and hard to answer: what should be
        automated, what has to stay human, and how do we prove the system did the right thing.
      </p>

      <h2>Learning</h2>

      <p>
        Container orchestration, cloud security, and how large engineering organisations turn
        compliance requirements into platform capabilities rather than paperwork. I am also
        paying close attention to the gap between an AI prototype that impresses people and a
        production system an auditor will accept.
      </p>

      <h2>Writing</h2>

      <p>
        Publishing here weekly. Longer essays when I have an argument worth defending, shorter
        reading notes when someone else has already made the point better than I could.
      </p>

      <h2>Reading</h2>

      <p>
        Returning to founder writing, developer experience and pragmatic technology strategy.
        Paul Graham, Addy Osmani and the ThoughtWorks Technology Radar are the three I come
        back to most.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="page__note">
      This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" rel="noopener">now page</a>. It describes
      what has my attention at the date above, and nothing more.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-block: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .page h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-title-lg);
    max-width: 20ch;
  }

  .page__updated {
    font-size: var(--step-caption);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin-block: var(--space-s) var(--space-xl);
  }

  .page__note {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-l);
    border-top: var(--rule-weight) solid var(--rule);
    font-size: var(--step-caption);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  .page__note a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
